# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
#
# Zola has NO app-level API credentials — each user's own Zola refresh token
# (the long-lived `usr` cookie value) arrives through the connector's OAuth
# login form (served at /authorize), not from here. There is nothing required
# in this file to run the hosted connector locally; it exists only as the
# conventional place for any future Worker-only dev override.
